<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Lindum Reefs March quarter profits rise.</title>
<headline>Lindum Reefs March quarter profits rise.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-March versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit before capital spending 3.06 vs 1.27</p>
<p>    Capital spending			 0.28 vs 0.63</p>
<p>    Tonnes milled			 264,000 vs 218,000</p>
<p>    Gold output (kg)			  535 vs 379</p>
<p>    Yield (gram/t)			   2.03 vs 1.74</p>
<p>    Cost (rand/kg)			 45,396 vs 52,356</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand/kg)		    51,456 vs 55,923</p>
<p>Full name: Lindum Reefs Gold Mining Co Ltd</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
